invariant: INV-39
file: handshake.c
catches: tcp_blocking_loop_test
reason: the tcp-blocking client completes on a server Finished that has
  bytes after it in its record, and drops them when it resets cfg.buf for
  ch_read. RFC 9846 section 5.1 makes that unexpected_message.
  test/tcp_blocking_loop_test.c seals the Finished again with one byte
  after it and requires that alert.

--- old
    // And after the server Finished. The check runs before the epoch
    // commit and the client Finished, so a refused flight moves no stored
    // epoch and gets no Finished back.
    rc = hsr_check_record_end(h);
    if (rc != CH_OK) {
        return rc;
    }
--- new
